    {
      "id": "file:common/log/custom_rotating_file_sink.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "custom_rotating_file_sink.h",
      "filePath": "common/log/custom_rotating_file_sink.h",
      "summary": "自定义的 spdlog 按大小轮转文件 sink 模板类，继承自 base_sink，支持日志文件按大小自动轮转和 rename 语义。",
      "tags": ["logging", "spdlog-sink", "template-class", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用模板参数 Mutex 区分多线程版本 (mt) 和单线程版本 (st)，并通过 SPDLOG_HEADER_ONLY 宏控制是否包含内联实现。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/log/logger.cc",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "logger.cc",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger.cc",
      "summary": "Logger 单例类的薄包装实现文件，将所有日志操作委托给内部 LoggerImpl 类，是日志系统的公共 API 入口。",
      "tags": ["logging", "singleton", "facade", "entry-point"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/log/logger.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "logger.h",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger.h",
      "summary": "日志系统的公共头文件，定义了 Logger 单例类、LogStreamOptimized RAII 流式日志辅助类、LogRateLimiter 速率限制器以及 LOG/LOG_TIME 宏。",
      "tags": ["logging", "public-api", "singleton", "macro", "header"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "LOG 宏利用 ShouldLog 短路求值和 LogStreamOptimized 析构函数自动提交日志，实现流式日志语法。LogRateLimiter 使用 thread_local 存储实现线程安全的速率限制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/log/logger_impl.cc",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "logger_impl.cc",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger_impl.cc",
      "summary": "LoggerImpl 的核心实现文件，负责 spdlog 的初始化、同步/异步 logger 创建、sink 配置、日志级别管理、配置文件热加载以及环境变量覆盖。",
      "tags": ["logging", "implementation", "spdlog", "config-hot-reload", "core"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Init 方法支持多种 logger 类型（console/file/both），使用 spdlog thread pool 实现异步日志，LoggerConfigChecker 后台线程每秒检测配置文件变更并热重载。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/log/logger_impl.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "logger_impl.h",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger_impl.h",
      "summary": "LoggerImpl 类的头文件，定义了 Logger::LoggerImpl 内部实现类和 LoggerConfig 配置结构体，包含 JSON 配置解析和日志级别映射逻辑。",
      "tags": ["logging", "implementation", "config-parser", "header"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "LoggerConfig 使用 nlohmann/json 解析配置文件，通过 string 到 enum 的映射函数支持灵活的配置格式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/log/logger_test.cc",
